                      "<div class='hero-copy'><p class='eyebrow'><span class='eyebrow-dot'></span>Enterprise application platform</p><h1>Build enterprise applications faster \u2014 <em>without starting from scratch.</em></h1><p class='hero-lead'>AppLegos brings configurable applications, reusable building blocks, workflows, data integration, and automation into one foundation built for change.</p><div class='hero-actions'><a class='al-button al-button-primary' href='#demo'>Request a demo <span aria-hidden='true'>\u2192</span></a><a class='al-button al-button-quiet' href='#platform'>Explore the platform <span aria-hidden='true'>\u2193</span></a></div><p class='hero-note'><span>\u25cf</span>Made for product teams and the developers who support them.</p></div>",
