                      "<div class='section-intro'><p class='eyebrow'>The application delivery gap</p><h2>Enterprise applications shouldn't require starting from zero.</h2><p>Move from one-off delivery to a composable operating model that turns proven work into a durable advantage.</p></div><div class='process-compare'><div class='process-track'><small>THE TRADITIONAL PATH</small><div class='process-line'><span>Requirements</span><i>\u2192</i><span>Development</span><i>\u2192</i><span>Integration</span><i>\u2192</i><span>Testing</span><i>\u2192</i><span>Deployment</span><i>\u2192</i><span>Maintenance</span></div></div><div class='reuse-callout'><strong>Reuse instead of rebuild.</strong><span>Keep the right controls, workflows, and integrations available for the next application.</span></div><div class='process-track app-legos'><small>THE APPLEGOS PATH</small><div class='process-line'><span>Configure</span><i>\u2192</i><span>Compose</span><i>\u2192</i><span>Integrate</span><i>\u2192</i><span>Automate</span><i>\u2192</i><span>Deploy</span></div></div></div>"
