                      "<div class='section-intro centered-intro'><p class='eyebrow'>Tailored platform experience</p><h2>Built for product leaders and engineering teams.</h2><p>AppLegos bridges vision and execution, giving product managers speed and developers total architectural control.</p></div><div class='personas-grid'><article class='persona-card persona-product'><div class='persona-header'><span class='persona-badge product-badge'><b>\u25a6</b> Product Managers</span><h3>Turn requirements into working applications faster.</h3><p class='persona-desc'>Empower product teams to model workflows, iterate on UI components, and deliver value without waiting on full dev sprints.</p></div><ul class='persona-features'><li><span class='feature-check'>\u2713</span><div><strong>Configure visually</strong><span>Build screens, forms, and navigation drag-and-drop.</span></div></li><li><span class='feature-check'>\u2713</span><div><strong>Reuse proven blocks</strong><span>Instantly leverage pre-tested UI and business logic.</span></div></li><li><span class='feature-check'>\u2713</span><div><strong>Model workflows</strong><span>Define multi-step operational logic and approvals.</span></div></li><li><span class='feature-check'>\u2713</span><div><strong>Accelerate delivery</strong><span>Dramatically reduce engineering bottlenecks.</span></div></li></ul><div class='persona-footer'><a class='persona-cta cta-product' href='#demo'>See product workflow <span aria-hidden='true'>\u2192</span></a></div></article><article class='persona-card persona-dev'><div class='persona-header'><span class='persona-badge dev-badge'><b>\u2318</b> Software Developers</span><h3>Build once. Reuse everywhere.</h3><p class='persona-desc'>Focus engineering time on core infrastructure and custom business logic, while AppLegos handles repetitive scaffolding.</p></div><ul class='persona-features'><li><span class='feature-check'>\u2713</span><div><strong>Extendable architecture</strong><span>Plug in custom APIs, custom code, and microservices.</span></div></li><li><span class='feature-check'>\u2713</span><div><strong>APIs &amp; integrations</strong><span>Seamlessly bind enterprise databases and REST endpoints.</span></div></li><li><span class='feature-check'>\u2713</span><div><strong>Reusable components</strong><span>Publish custom widgets back into the platform registry.</span></div></li><li><span class='feature-check'>\u2713</span><div><strong>Enterprise governance</strong><span>Role-based access, audit trails, and security defaults.</span></div></li></ul><div class='persona-footer'><a class='persona-cta cta-dev' href='/home/services'>Explore platform services <span aria-hidden='true'>\u2192</span></a></div></article></div>"
